    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "THE SATURDAY EVENING\nPOST\n10D0\nThe Tower of London guards\nare proud of\nTheir traditions.\nNorman\nGay Parce has the best floor shows, and the\nbest menus. Ther's something for everybody in this beautiful city.\nsays\n\"Pan American was my\nEast meets west at Hongkong\nYou can see modern\nskyscrapers in the city, sampans\nand junks in the harbor.\nPAA\nFor real sukiyaki in\nTokyo, you leave your shoes outside, sit on the floor."
